{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121923","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121923/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121923/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121923/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121923","id":5016936873,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc74XvXg","number":121923,"title":"Core: Remove assignment in Variant Object destructor","user":{"login":"aurpine","id":12262539,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjYyNTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12262539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine","html_url":"https://github.com/aurpine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-07-30T06:32:12Z","updated_at":"2026-08-23T02:55:59Z","closed_at":"2026-08-21T16:25:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121923","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121923","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121923.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121923.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-21T16:25:20Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\nSequel to #121834. <sub>This should have been combined but hindsight 20/20.</sub>\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Optimizes  `Object` typed `Variant` destruction by not assigning an empty `ObjData`.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n`Variant` `Object*` is used heavily in function calls. Currently the `Variant` destructor cleans up the pointer data which is unnecessary. I suspect this one is more difficult for the compiler to optimized out since it is scoped in an if branch within a function call.\r\n\r\nProfiling of an empty GDScript function call in a loop.\r\n\r\n```py\r\nfunc fn():\r\n    pass\r\n\r\nfor i in 1_000_000:\r\n    fn()\r\n```\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n<img width=\"514\" height=\"281\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/46bbb43a-7fee-4559-badb-9be2290a340f\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"508\" height=\"302\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f09518d3-f0a0-4666-b7ae-43af9922dcd6\" />\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\nThis does change the behaviour slightly. The only other call site of `_clear_internal` is in `VariantInternal::clear` which already does not zero out the `_data` for numeric types for example. \r\nAdditionally it sets the `type = NIL` which would correctly be zeroed out if followed up with a call to `VariantInternal::initialize` or `VariantTypeChanger::change` for Object types.\r\n\r\n### Future work\r\n\r\nThere are a few more cases that similarly call `unref` which zeroes a pointer.\r\n\r\nIn called destructor:\r\n* `StringName`\r\n* `NodePath`\r\n* `Callable`\r\n* `Dictionary`\r\n* `Array`\r\n\r\nDirectly in `_clear_internal`\r\n* `Transform2D`\r\n* `AABB`\r\n* `Basis`\r\n* `Transform3D`\r\n* `Projection`\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121923/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":3,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121923/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}